  "label": "anti_latino_hispanic_stereotypes",
  "description": "The meme is designed to target and resonate with audiences who hold anti-Latino/Hispanic stereotypes, particularly those who believe in the narrative that Latino and Hispanic immigrants are 'illegal immigrants' who 'take land' and are portrayed as invaders. This stereotype is rooted in real-world xenophobic and racist tropes targeting Latino communities, often used to justify exclusionary policies and promote hostile attitudes toward immigrants.",
